{"id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-elementary-topos.md","title":"Definition — Elementary Topos","display":"Definition — Elementary Topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-elementary-topos","aliases":["14-df-elementary-topos"],"display":"Definition — Elementary Topos","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-functor]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-elementary-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-elementary-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Elementary Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4bf0b109a78ca196\" href=\"?note=4bf0b109a78ca196\" title=\"14-df-cartesian-closed-category\">14-df-cartesian-closed-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (category, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsLimit}\\)</span> (limit-cone predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}\\)</span> (Cartesian-closed predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4bf0b109a78ca196\" href=\"?note=4bf0b109a78ca196\" title=\"14-df-cartesian-closed-category\">14-df-cartesian-closed-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}\\)</span> (classifier predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor}\\)</span> (object and morphism sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits},\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits},\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall J,D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land|\\mathrm{Mor}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\;\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal E}(L,\\pi,D)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists\\Omega,\\top\\;\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall J,D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land|\\mathrm{Mor}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\;\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal E}(L,\\pi,D)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists\\Omega,\\top\\;\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：IV.1 Definition of a Topos，印刷页 161–166。</p>\n<p>采用有限极限、笛卡儿闭、子对象分类子的等价定义。有限指标同时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小，以匹配 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a> 的极限签名；任意有限图形均可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中的有限集重标号。这不是要求任意小极限；有限指标条件包含空范畴，故包含终对象。分类子谓词始终在当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category","status":"resolved","id":"4bf0b109a78ca196","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)$ (category, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id"