,\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\forall J,D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(J)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land|\\mathrm{Mor}(J)|\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal E)\\to\\exists L,\\pi\\;\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathcal E}(L,\\pi,D)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists\\Omega,\\top\\;\\mathrm{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false}],"bytes":2147,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos|Definition — Elementary Topos]]"},{"id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。当 $\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 $\\mathrm{Neg}_X$；$\\vee$ 表示该结构的 $\\vee_X$。$\\mathrm{IsBoolean}$ 是以下定义的谓词。"},{"id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c10899c45464ad7f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d70b287bd93237ef","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c22badb838a7fca1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1