top)$ 与有限极限。"},{"id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathcal E)$ (topos, see [[14-df-elementary-topos]])"},{"id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子和二元积及其投影、配对；这些数据采用 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]。$S=(S_0,F,R,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{out})$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名。对 $H:S_0\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，有限积 $\\Pi_H$ 按下式从左到右递归；$\\pi_i$ 表示其递归复合得到的第 $i$ 个投影。"},{"id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。"},{"id":"7df95b777d9b2ddd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。"},{"id":"31aff49e22ab64ab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]"},{"id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b6a2f7cb930ac02","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，$u:X\\to Y$。$A\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$，$a:A_0\\hookrightarrow X$ 为任一代表；$B,C\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(Y)$。子对象次序与拉回采用 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]、[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]；$\\operatorname{Im}$ 采用 [[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]。$Q_u$ 是 [[14-thm-dependent-product-quantifier]] 从依赖积构造的子对象函数。"},{"id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f8203c598905a7b7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos|Definition — Elementary Topos]]"},{"id":"8e769e1f3e412be1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba35738413a412b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。$K,D$ 在 Assertion 中量化，小性、函子和余极限谓词分别见 [[14-df-small-category]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-limits-colimits]]；$\\mathbb N=\\omega$。"},{"id":"e9217897da5ded39","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f0231586326fcfff","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1895c20f7dacd11c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a62d3691c564e069","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。在其成立的分支，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]] 的 $\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$；$\\wedge,\\leq$ 分别缩写该结构的 $\\wedge_X,\\leq_X$，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 见 [[14-df-heyting-negation]]。"},{"id":"89152b1252304fa8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 $1$、分类子 $(\\Omega,\\top)$ 与有限极限。"},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-elementary-topos]] 的初等拓扑斯